     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"IGCFG-01\"> </a></b>Fork IG template</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can fork the smart-ig-empty template repository using 'Use this Template' with 'Include all branches' to ensure gh-pages branch is cloned.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"IGCFG-02\"> </a></b>Configure sushi-config.yaml</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can configure sushi-config.yaml with correct canonical URL (https://smart.who.int/&lt;ig_code&gt;), package ID (smart.who.int.&lt;ig_code&gt;), and dependencies.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"IGCFG-03\"> </a></b>Enable GitHub Pages</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can enable GitHub Pages from the gh-pages branch and confirm repo allows GitHub Actions read/write access.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"IGCFG-04\"> </a></b>Configure for national adaptations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can configure package IDs for national adaptations following HL7 affiliate conventions (hl7.fhir.country.smart.&lt;ig_code&gt;).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-IGCFG-01\"> </a></b>Fork IG template</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can fork the smart-ig-empty template repository using 'Use this Template' with 'Include all branches' to ensure gh-pages branch is cloned.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-IGCFG-02\"> </a></b>Configure sushi-config.yaml</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can configure sushi-config.yaml with correct canonical URL (https://smart.who.int/&lt;ig_code&gt;), package ID (smart.who.int.&lt;ig_code&gt;), and dependencies.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-IGCFG-03\"> </a></b>Enable GitHub Pages</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can enable GitHub Pages from the gh-pages branch and confirm repo allows GitHub Actions read/write access.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-IGCFG-04\"> </a></b>Configure for national adaptations</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can configure package IDs for national adaptations following HL7 affiliate conventions (hl7.fhir.country.smart.&lt;ig_code&gt;).</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.ConfigureIG\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.PublicationManager.html\">Publication Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-IGCFG-01\"> </a></b>Fork IG template</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can fork the smart-ig-empty template repository using 'Use this Template' with 'Include all branches' to ensure gh-pages branch is cloned.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-IGCFG-02\"> </a></b>Configure sushi-config.yaml</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can configure